---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import SectionHeading from '../../components/SectionHeading.astro';
import Hero from '../../components/Hero.astro';
import { useTranslations } from '../../i18n/utils';

const lang = 'en';
const t = useTranslations(lang);
---

<Layout title={t('nav.about')} description={t('meta.about.description')} ogImage="/og/about.jpg" schema={{
  "@type": "AboutPage",
  "name": t('nav.about'),
  "description": t('meta.about.description'),
  "url": "https://babaji.org.pl/en/about",
  "inLanguage": "en"
}}>
  <Hero
    title={t('nav.about')}
    subtitle="Truth, Simplicity, Love"
    ctaText="Contact"
    ctaLink="/en/contact"
    size="large"
  />

  <div class="about-page">
    <section class="intro">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="content-grid">
          <div class="text-content reveal">
            <p class="eyebrow">the place</p>
            <h2>Our mission</h2>
            <p>
              <strong>Babaji Ashram</strong> is a spiritual center in Mąkolno, Lower Silesia, dedicated to the teachings of
              <a href="/en/babaji">Sri Haidakhan Babaji</a>. Since 1990 it has been a place for practice,
              meditation, and service grounded in three pillars: <strong>Truth, Simplicity, and Love</strong>.
            </p>
            <p>
              Through Karma Yoga, Japa Yoga, and shared life close to nature, the Ashram holds a daily rhythm
              that supports inner quiet, steadiness, and spiritual discipline.
            </p>

            <h2>Sri Haidakhan Babaji</h2>
            <p>
              Babaji taught that in the present age, repetition of God&apos;s name and selfless service are essential.
              His message crosses religious boundaries and invites people of every background to follow the path of the heart.
            </p>
            <p>
              Learn more on the page about <a href="/en/babaji">Sri Haidakhan Babaji</a>.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="image-content reveal">
            <img src="/images/gallery/babaji-with-devotees-vintage.webp" alt="Sri Haidakhan Babaji with devotees at the ashram construction site" />
            <div class="image-ornament"></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="pillars-section">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="pillars-grid reveal-children">
          <div class="pillar-card">
            <div class="pillar-icon">☉</div>
            <h3>Truth</h3>
            <p>Honesty in thought, speech, and action. The ground of any serious spiritual path.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="pillar-card pillar-card--offset">
            <div class="pillar-icon">○</div>
            <h3>Simplicity</h3>
            <p>Life lived close to nature. A quiet refusal of what is unnecessary.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="pillar-card">
            <div class="pillar-icon">♥</div>
            <h3>Love</h3>
            <p>Care expressed through service. Practice becomes real when it reaches other people.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="eeat">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section-split reveal">
          <div>
            <p class="eyebrow">community</p>
            <SectionHeading title="Experience and community" subtitle="Practice becomes visible in the way the day is lived" align="left" />
          </div>
          <p class="section-note">
            The Ashram is not designed as a retreat product. It is a working place shaped by ritual,
            service, quiet, and shared responsibility.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="eeat-grid reveal-children">
          <div class="eeat-card">
            <div class="card-icon">☀</div>
            <h3>Daily practice</h3>
            <p>
              Karma Yoga, meditation, japa, Aarti, and Havan form a daily rhythm that builds steadiness and attention.
            </p>
            <a href="/en/practices">Explore practices →</a>
          </div>
          <div class="eeat-card">
            <div class="card-icon">✦</div>
            <h3>Programs and events</h3>
            <p>
              Retreats, workshops, and spiritual festivals create moments of concentrated shared practice.
            </p>
            <a href="/en/events">Upcoming events →</a>
          </div>
          <div class="eeat-card">
            <div class="card-icon">❋</div>
            <h3>Guests and volunteering</h3>
            <p>
              Visitors are welcome to take part in the atmosphere of service, openness, and simple daily life.
            </p>
            <a href="/en/contact">Get in touch →</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="ashrams">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section-split reveal">
          <div>
            <p class="eyebrow">place</p>
            <SectionHeading title="Our center" align="left" />
          </div>
          <p class="section-note">
            The physical space matters here. The surrounding landscape, the temple rooms, and the working grounds
            are all part of the practice.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="ashram-grid reveal-children">
          <div class="ashram-card">
            <div class="ashram-image">
              <img src="/images/gallery/ashram-courtyard-garden-archway.webp" alt="Ashram courtyard in Mąkolno with a brick archway" />
            </div>
            <div class="card-content">
              <h3>Ashram in Mąkolno</h3>
              <p>
                A long-standing place of fire ceremony, Aarti, and shared work. Set in the Golden Mountains,
                it offers a calm physical setting for people who want to stay close to practice.
              </p>
              <p class="address">
                <strong>Address:</strong><br />
                Mąkolno 129<br />
                57-250 Mąkolno
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</Layout>

<style>
  .about-page {
    padding-bottom: 4rem;
  }

  .container {
    width: min(100% - 2.5rem, 1200px);
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  section {
    padding: 5rem 0;
  }

  .eyebrow {
    margin: 0 0 1rem;
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.24em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-text-light);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .intro {
    background: var(--color-bg);
  }

  .content-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 5rem;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .text-content h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-family-serif);
    color: var(--color-orange);
    font-size: 1.8rem;
    margin-top: 2.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .text-content h2:first-of-type {
    margin-top: 0;
  }

  .text-content p {
    line-height: 1.9;
    color: var(--color-text);
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    font-size: 1.05rem;
  }

  .text-content strong {
    color: var(--color-orange);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .image-content {
    position: relative;
  }

  .image-content img {
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
    box-shadow: 0 20px 40px -10px rgba(155, 85, 57, 0.2), 0 10px 20px -5px rgba(155, 85, 57, 0.1);
  }

  .image-ornament {
    position: absolute;
    top: -20px;
    right: -20px;
    width: 80px;
    height: 80px;
    border: 2px solid var(--color-gold);
    border-radius: var(--radius-m);
    opacity: 0.3;
    z-index: -1;
  }

  .pillars-section {
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, var(--color-bg) 0%, var(--color-bg-alt) 100%);
  }

  .pillars-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 2rem;
  }

  .pillar-card {
    text-align: center;
    padding: 3rem 2rem;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(255, 252, 247, 0.9) 0%, rgba(250, 248, 245, 0.7) 100%);
    border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
    box-shadow: 0 20px 40px -30px rgba(58, 35, 20, 0.24), inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85);
    transition: transform 320ms cubic-bezier(0.32, 0.72, 0, 1), box-shadow 320ms cubic-bezier(0.32, 0.72, 0, 1);
  }

  .pillar-card--offset {
    transform: translateY(2rem);
  }

  .pillar-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-8px);
    box-shadow: 0 24px 46px -26px rgba(58, 35, 20, 0.3), inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.95);
  }

  .pillar-icon {
    font-size: 2.5rem;
    color: var(--color-gold);
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    display: block;
    text-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(212, 175, 119, 0.4);
  }

  .pillar-card h3 {
    font-family: var(--font-family-serif);
    color: var(--color-orange);
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .pillar-card p {
    color: var(--color-text-light);
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .eeat {
    background: var(--color-bg-warm);
  }

  .section-split {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(16rem, 24rem);
    gap: 2rem;
    align-items: end;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .section-split :global(.section-heading) {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .section-note {
    margin: 0;
    max-width: none;
    color: var(--color-text-medium);
  }

  .eeat-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr));
    gap: 2rem;
  }

  .eeat-card {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(255, 252, 247, 0.95) 0%, rgba(250, 248, 245, 0.75) 100%);
    border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
    padding: 2.5rem;
    box-shadow: 0 20px 40px -28px rgba(58, 35, 20, 0.26), inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.9);
    transition: transform 320ms cubic-bezier(0.32, 0.72, 0, 1), box-shadow 320ms cubic-bezier(0.32, 0.72, 0, 1);
  }

  .eeat-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-6px);
    box-shadow: 0 28px 48px -28px rgba(58, 35, 20, 0.34), inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 1);
  }

  .card-icon {
    font-size: 2rem;
    color: var(--color-gold);
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    display: block;
  }

  .eeat-card h3 {
    font-family: var(--font-family-serif);
    color: var(--color-text);
    font-size: 1.4rem;
    margin-top: 0;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .eeat-card p {
    color: var(--color-text-light);
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .eeat-card a {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    color: var(--color-orange);
    text-decoration: none;
    font-weight: 600;
    transition: gap 220ms ease, text-shadow 220ms ease;
  }

  .eeat-card a:hover {
    gap: 0.75rem;
    text-shadow: 0 0 8px rgba(155, 85, 57, 0.25);
  }

  .ashrams {
    background: var(--color-bg-alt);
  }

  .ashram-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(350px, 1fr));
    gap: 3rem;
  }

  .ashram-card {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(255, 252, 247, 0.9) 0%, rgba(250, 248, 245, 0.7) 100%);
    border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
    overflow: hidden;
    box-shadow: 0 24px 44px -30px rgba(58, 35, 20, 0.26), inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.9);
    transition: transform 320ms cubic-bezier(0.32, 0.72, 0, 1), box-shadow 320ms cubic-bezier(0.32, 0.72, 0, 1);
  }

  .ashram-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-6px);
    box-shadow: 0 30px 54px -30px rgba(58, 35, 20, 0.32), inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 1);
  }

  .ashram-image {
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .ashram-image img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 280px;
    object-fit: cover;
    transition: transform 0.6s cubic-bezier(0.32, 0.72, 0, 1);
  }

  .ashram-card:hover .ashram-image img {
    transform: scale(1.05);
  }

  .card-content {
    padding: 2.5rem;
  }

  .card-content h3 {
    font-family: var(--font-family-serif);
    color: var(--color-text);
    font-size: 1.6rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
  }

  .card-content p {
    color: var(--color-text-light);
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .address {
    font-style: italic;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    padding-top: 1.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 0 !important;
    color: var(--color-text) !important;
  }

  @media (max-width: 1024px) {
    .pillars-grid,
    .section-split {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .pillar-card--offset {
      transform: none;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .container {
      width: min(100% - 1.5rem, 1200px);
    }

    .content-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 3rem;
    }

    .image-content {
      order: -1;
    }

    section {
      padding: 3rem 0;
    }
  }
</style>
